     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, <br>As a last resort, I hope someone in this group will be able to shed some light on issues I&#39;ve been having while trying to build/run a SEM using lavaan.<br><br>The problem: lavaan keeps throwing more and more errors including...<br>-------------------------<br>Warning message:\nIn lav_samplestats_from_data(lavdata = lavdata, missing = lavoptions$missing, :\n lavaan WARNING: sample covariance can not be inverted<br><br>Warning message:\nIn lav_data_full(data = data, group = group, group.label = group.label, :\n lavaan WARNING: unordered factor(s) with more than 2 levels detected in data: BugTreat\n<br><br>Error in fitMeasures(object, fit.measures = &quot;default&quot;) : \n object &#39;logl.H1&#39; not found<br>-------------------------<br><br>The sample covariance error was the first one to show up, and is the one I&#39;ve been trying to fix.  However, more and more errors are thrown, so I haven&#39;t even been able to address this. <br><br>I have included my code for a simple example model below. I have also included the data from dput().  <br><br>--------------------<br><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Abun2 &lt;- read.csv(&quot;GzrAbun_SEM_MSIII_2009_DATA TO SHARE.csv&quot;, header=T)<br>\n\nnames(Abun2)<br>\n\nstr(Abun2)<br>\n\n<br></span></font>#Examine the covariance matrix<br><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Amat2 &lt;- Abun2[,c(9:26)]<br>\n\ncov(Amat2)</span></font><br><br><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">library(lavaan)<br></span></font><br><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"># Model BB<br>\n\nmodbb &lt;- &#39;Sc200_FinalAbun ~ Sc200_Stock + BugTreat +  TempTreat<br>\n\n           Sc201_FinalAbun ~ Sc201_Stock + </span></font><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">BugTreat +</span></font> TempTreat<br>\n\n           Sc202_FinalAbun ~ Sc202_Stock + </span></font><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">BugTreat +</span></font> TempTreat<br>\n\n           Sc203_FinalAbun ~ Sc203_Stock + </span></font><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">BugTreat +</span></font> TempTreat<br>\n\n           Sc210_FinalAbun ~ Sc210_Stock +  TempTreat<br>\n\n           Sc211_FinalAbun ~ Sc211_Stock +  TempTreat &#39;<br>\n\n# Fit the model (estimate the parameters)<br>\n\nmodbb_fit &lt;- sem(modbb, data=Abun2, fixed.x=FALSE)<br>\n\n# Output a summary of the computed results<br>\n\nsummary(modbb_fit, rsq=T, standardized=T, fit.measures=TRUE)  <br>\n\n-------------------------<br></span></font>#Data<br><br>&gt; dput(Abun2)\n<br>structure(list(Meso = c(46L, 64L, 80L, 7L, 16L, 32L, 53L, 50L, \n42L, 63L, 73L, 9L, 23L, 27L, 48L, 59L, 62L, 78L, 5L, 18L, 26L, \n84L, 44L, 69L, 4L, 13L, 25L, 54L, 39L, 58L, 71L, 76L, 36L, 6L, \n19L, 51L, 47L, 68L, 77L, 8L, 14L, 30L, 52L, 43L, 66L, 81L, 11L, \n24L, 33L, 34L, 37L, 56L, 65L, 79L, 2L, 20L, 55L, 67L, 75L, 38L, \n12L, 22L, 31L, 70L, 83L, 41L, 49L, 3L, 15L, 28L, 60L, 72L, 82L, \n35L, 40L, 10L, 17L, 57L, 61L, 74L, 45L, 1L, 21L, 29L), GzrTreat = structure(c(1L, \n1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, \n1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, \n3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, \n3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, \n2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, \n2L, 2L, 2L), .Label = c(&quot;I&quot;, &quot;N&quot;, &quot;R&quot;), class = &quot;factor&quot;), BugTreat = structure(c(2L, \n2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, \n2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 2L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, \n1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, \n1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, \n3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, 3L, \n3L, 3L, 3L), .Lab